# URL-level excludes for the `lint / links` (lychee) check, read additively by
# lychee's own default ignore-file discovery. Each line is a regex matched
# against the (resolved) link. This repo has no local lychee.toml — the
# shared qte77/.github workflow fetches its lychee.toml fallback, which this
# file layers on top of.

# Placeholder example URLs in template/example docs — intentionally fake,
# never meant to resolve.
https://github\.com/your_project_here
https://techcrunch\.com/2024/article-title
https://gartner\.com/report-link
